# cmd/sonneck-desktop (Wails native build) — build/bin is wails build's own
# compiled-app output (the equivalent of the root /bin/ entry above);
# frontend/wailsjs is auto-regenerated by every `wails build` even though
# nothing in this binary actually uses Wails' JS runtime/Bind mechanism
# (see that command's own main.go header comment) — frontend/.gitkeep
# itself stays committed so the directory exists without it.
cmd/sonneck-desktop/build/bin/
cmd/sonneck-desktop/frontend/wailsjs/
